From 68826965443d70797adb176156084f8632cf834e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qiyinxi <qiyinxi@foxmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 15:15:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 072/101] MAS local: harden toolbar shutdown and window
 navigation

Place the navigation column in the reserved viewport margin with a black surface, add native dark title-bar attributes, and keep the full-toolbar and non-Windows paths unchanged. Start the external shutdown watchdog before guest power-down, add the main-loop exit fallback, and preserve console-requested exits.

Change-Id: I6e4a2c8f0b7d9e1a3c5f7b2d4e6a8c0f1b3d5e7
